<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n150\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n150\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―The presence of people, the presence of animals, and every sound of nature are being drowned out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Except, that is, for the sound of the rain and the thunder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I go into the settlement now, I probably won't need to hide my presence as much as before.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{PLAYMOVIE "雨2早い.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
No, if anything, everyone in the settlement might be all the more wary of what's outside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than hiding my presence, I have to take a route that's a blind spot from every house.<PG>
I go back in among the trees and head toward the Niimura house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't need to worry about my footsteps, but I have to watch out for eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There could even be residents with their hunting rifles at the ready.<PG>
The people of the Arata settlement are timid and belligerent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once they know there's danger, they go straight for the threat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I reveal that I'm <STYLE ID="1">Haruka Niimura</STYLE>, it won't do any good if a gun goes off before that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, like <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> said, I might be taken for an outsider.<PG>
Whether I'm from Arata or not doesn't matter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the day the settlement was prophesied to perish, <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="・・・・">by sheer chance</STYLE>, I come swooping down into it for the first time in 2 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some people might find that <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="けげん">suspicious</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
That's <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="・・・・">just-in-case</STYLE> caution.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this is a vicious circle...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on my end, I'm wary of the people in the settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n150\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Okay, I managed to get into the yard of the Niimura house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Kana</STYLE> should be keeping watch outside, so <STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE> should be inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those two probably won't be wary even if they see me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I don't sense anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe everyone's out?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As always, the veranda door was unlocked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I go into the second-floor room I was given 2 years ago.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The room is the same as it was 2 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looks like it's been cleaned regularly, but my things are just as they were when I left for the mountain seclusion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Guess I'll change clothes, at least.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mountain seclusion isn't over, but I need to clean myself up so people are even a little less wary of me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\桜雨.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―I change clothes and chop my hair back to the length it was when I came here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't cut it well, but it's fine as long as people can tell it's me from my silhouette.<PG>
I looked at my face in a mirror for the first time in 2 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's changed less than I thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I figured I'd be pretty tanned, but I'm still fairly pale.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Itohime Hot Spring seems to work even on that kind of survival life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, never mind that right now. I need to find <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I look around the house.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家洗面所.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There's no sign of anyone anywhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where could <STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE> and the others have gone in rain like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, maybe I'll wait for the rain to stop...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
My phone, touched for the first time in 2 years―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will it still work?<PG>
No good, it won't turn on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dead battery?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I plug in the charger and try to start it up again.<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
............
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
All right, it's on!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I canceled my contract before the mountain seclusion, so it probably won't connect.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can connect to this house's Wi-Fi―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yeah, the internet connection's okay.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And calls should work too through an app, as long as I'm in Wi-Fi range.<PG>
I skim through 2 years' worth of messages and missed calls and stuff.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surprisingly, my fingertips remember how to work it.<PG>
Looks like messages kept coming regularly from <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The messages from 2 years ago are about whether I'm safe, but that gradually changes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The messages, about once a week, tell what happened that week, or just say a little something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were messages that seemed to be trying to hold on to their bond with me, even if only a little.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A sudden ringtone―
{PAUSE ""}
a shrill electronic sound blares out, as if slicing through the sound of the rain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A new message from <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE>, just now...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A message right at the moment I looked...<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="10">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, did you see the message!? It says read!?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh right, it tells them when I've looked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
And then another message came.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">“Today </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> and I are thinking of going to the Arata settlement. </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, are you at the settlement?”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "600" "5000" "PASS"}
............!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hey, hey, hey, hey! You've gotta be kidding!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something from the outside world that destroys the settlement... it can't be...!<PG>
No! If they come now, who knows what'll be done to them!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've gotta call <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE> right now and tell her!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Um, I'm pretty sure the free-call app is―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\白般若シルエット.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "0" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............!?"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Someone... behind me...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was so caught up in the rain and the message that I didn't sense anyone there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I got careless...! Who hit me...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE>... don't come...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">You</STYLE> can tell with your intuition, right...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Please, don't come...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dammit...! I can't move...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My vision's blurring... 
{PAUSE ""}
the sound of the rain is in the way... 
{PAUSE ""}
I can't grasp what's going on.<PG>
My mind is clear, but my motor nerves and five senses are shot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\歪むカオ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "600" "5000" "PASS"}
No... this is exactly when I need to stay calm...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've been pushed to my limit over and over in the mountain seclusion!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When you can't do anything, focus only on what you can do!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Otherwise, <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> will...!<PG>
First, I check my own consciousness and my five senses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Consciousness... 
{PAUSE ""}
mostly fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sight... 
{PAUSE ""}
almost nothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing... 
{PAUSE ""}
no problem.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Smell... 
{PAUSE ""}
no problem.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Touch... 
{PAUSE ""}
no problem.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Taste... 
{PAUSE ""}
unknown.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My body... 
{PAUSE ""}
my fingertips move slightly.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Someone pulls me by the arm and drags me across the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are they planning to move me somewhere?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
If I'm being dragged, there's only one of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A man could probably carry me on his shoulder, so―a woman?<PG>
No, maybe they're dragging me on purpose, to make it look like a woman or a lone culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dammit... I've got nothing solid to narrow down who it is...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least I can tell there's no murderous intent toward me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So... so what does this mean?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What can I actually tell from this situation right now?<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> could probably work out both the situation and the culprit from here, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, today <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> are coming here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The culprit hit me just when I was trying to contact <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means they're trying to make <STYLE ID="8">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> come here?<PG>
No, the culprit probably didn't <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="のぞ">peek</STYLE> at the messages on my phone before hitting me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Argh! My head can't take this any further...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\新村本家2階ぼやけ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A dozen or so seconds since I got hit on the head―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My vision starts coming back, and I can tell my body moves too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I'm still being dragged along at the culprit's mercy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could launch a surprise attack here, but I'll stay like this and see how things go for a while.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
